Complete a regression test for this pinned repository function. Only edit test_contract.py.
Identify archive format from its path suffix: .tar.gz and .tgz mean tar.gz, .tar.zst means tar.zst, and .zip means zip. The harness converts the one input string to pathlib.Path before calling the exact function. Cover all four supported suffixes; use only supported paths, not exception tests.
